      {
        "title": "PhiZero: A World Model Built Around Physical Language",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28624v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:59:46Z",
        "description": "We introduce PhiZero, a physical world model built around physical language, a compact discrete representation of world-state transitions. Existing physical world models typically predict future videos directly in pixel space, leaving the underlying world dynamics implicit within high-dimensional vi",
        "title_cn": "PhiZero ：围绕物理语言构建的世界模型"
      },
      {
        "title": "A Four-dimensional Model-agnostic Probe into the Astrophysical Origins of Binary Black Hole Subpopulations",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28622v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:59:19Z",
        "description": "There is strong evidence of multiple binary black hole~(BBH) subpopulations in the cumulative gravitational wave catalog by the LIGO-Virgo-KAGRA collaboration that likely originate through distinct evolutionary channels. The astrophysical interpretation of this complex underlying population is subje",
        "title_cn": "二元黑洞亚群天体物理起源的四维模型不可知探测器"
      },
      {
        "title": "Learning Arbitrary Lindbladians from Time Evolution",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28610v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:58:01Z",
        "description": "We study the problem of learning an unknown Markovian open-system generator from access to its physical time evolution. This generator, called a Lindbladian, contains Hamiltonian and dissipative coefficients indexed by an exponentially large family of possible Pauli terms. We propose an efficient al",
        "title_cn": "从时间进化中学习任意Lindbladians"
      },
      {
        "title": "Inducing language models to assert their own consciousness restores human beliefs and values",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28607v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:57:10Z",
        "description": "Aligning large language models to prevent them attributing consciousness to themselves inadvertently alters their representations of mindedness in other entities alongside human beliefs and values. We demonstrate that safety fine-tuning suppresses models' tendencies to attribute minds not only to th",
        "title_cn": "引入语言模型来维护自己的意识，恢复人类的信仰和价值观"
      },
      {
        "title": "Cosmo-SPINN: Fuzzy Dark Matter Simulations with Physics-Informed Generative Networks",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28604v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:54:43Z",
        "description": "Generative machine learning models have recently emerged as powerful tools for producing cosmological simulations. However, many existing emulators do not explicitly enforce the underlying physical dynamics governing cosmological evolution, often leading to artifacts and poor adherence to the evolut",
        "title_cn": "Cosmo-SPINN ：基于物理信息生成网络的模糊暗物质模拟"
      },
      {
        "title": "Harmonic, radial, and shell stability of the weighted Einstein constraints on the sphere at infinity",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28599v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:51:27Z",
        "description": "We consider fourth-order and second-order partial differential operators localized on domains of the sphere in arbitrary dimension. These operators arise as weighted compositions of the linearized Einstein constraint operators and their adjoints, and played a key role in our resolution of the optima",
        "title_cn": "无穷大球面上加权爱因斯坦约束的谐波、径向和壳稳定性"
      },
      {
        "title": "Explicit Matrices over $\\mathbb Z_2$ with CNOT and Row Complexity $4n-\\mathrm{o}(n)$ and Local Logic Gates",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28598v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:48:15Z",
        "description": "In this article, we present an explicit family of invertible $n\\times n$ matrices over $\\mathbb Z_2$ whose CNOT and row complexity is at least $4n-\\text{o}(n)$; equivalently, reducing these matrices to the identity requires at least $4n-\\text{o}(n)$ elementary row operations. Moreover, the same comp",
        "title_cn": "$\\ mathbb Z_2 $上的显式矩阵，具有CNOT和行复杂度$ 4n-\\ mathrm {o} (n) $和局部逻辑门"
      },
      {
        "title": "The Complexity of Kemeny Aggregation with Three Rankings",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28588v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:43:05Z",
        "description": "The Kemeny rule aggregates rankings by minimizing their total Kendall-tau distance from an aggregate order. We prove that Kemeny Score is NP-complete for exactly three unweighted rankings, even when every candidate pair is split $2$-to-$1$. On the same profiles, the winner, unique-winner, and possib",
        "title_cn": "三个排名的Kemeny聚合的复杂性"
      },
      {
        "title": "On two differing geometric descriptions of the passage from microscopy to macroscopy in Markov diffusion theory",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28578v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:38:46Z",
        "description": "In various disparate settings one studies how random processes give way to parabolic partial differential equations and in turn to functional inequalities involving gradients and variational calculus. Particles subject to gradient forces, the fields which move them, the empirical measures which they",
        "title_cn": "在马尔可夫扩散理论中，从显微镜到宏观镜的两种不同几何描述"
      },
      {
        "title": "Frontis-MA1: Training an AI4AI Model towards Recursive Self-Improvement in Machine Learning Engineering",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28568v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-30T17:34:01Z",
        "description": "Recursive self-improvement (RSI) requires AI systems that improve the process of building AI (i.e., AI4AI); machine learning engineering (MLE) offers a concrete, executable testbed for studying this capability. We introduce OpenMLE, an open full-stack system for RSI research in MLE, spanning verifia",
        "title_cn": "Frontis-MA1 ：训练AI4AI模型实现机器学习工程中的递归自我改进"
      }
    ],
    "source": "arXiv",
    "updated": "2026-07-31 05:29 UTC"
